# 📄 Universal PDF Merger (Streamlit)

A simple Streamlit app to merge multiple file types into a single PDF.

## ✅ Supported Formats
- PDF
- DOCX (Word)
- Images (JPG, PNG)

## 🚀 Features
- Upload multiple files
- Merge into one PDF
- Download merged file
- Preview PDF page-by-page

## ▶️ Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
